  "$comment": "Flexoki Dark. Source: https://stephango.com/flexoki. Licence: MIT. -400 steps. blue-400 cannot carry light or dark text, so accent_solid is the blue-600-class #1c507b with light text; danger text is red-300 #e8705f. The light block is Flexoki Light from https://stephango.com/flexoki (paper bg, base-50 bg-2, base-100/150 ui/ui-2, black tx, base-600 tx-2, base-300 tx-3, 600 accents), surface #ffffff derived (paper is the lightest upstream value) and success the green-700 #536907 because green-600 is 4.39:1 on paper.",
