  "primer": {
    "$comment": "Flexoki (dark) palette for gen-primer-theme. Source: https://stephango.com/flexoki + https://github.com/kepano/flexoki README (MIT) — black #100f0f, base-950 #1c1b1a, base-900 #282726, base-850 #343331, base-800 #403e3c, base-700 #575653, base-500 #878580, base-200 #cecdc3, paper #fffcf0; dark accents are the 400 shades: red #d14d41, orange #da702c, yellow #d0a215, green #879a39, cyan #3aa99f, blue #4385be, purple #8b7ec8, magenta #ce5d97. Base: @primer/primitives dark. Canvas black, raised base-950/900, borders base-850/800, text base-200 / muted base-500, accent + link blue-400, primary button light text on a blue-600-class shade, success green, danger red (text lightened to red-300 #e8705f), attention yellow, severe orange, done purple, sponsors magenta. Nothing darker than black, so inset/shadow (#0a0909) is derived.",
